{
  "description": "Predicate-logic model evaluator — a finite domain of objects with visible properties; the learner marks which ∀/∃ statements they believe true, evaluates them against the model, and can toggle object properties to flip a statement's truth. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
